{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796","agentId":"a3356c51d9d10daab","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 anytime CP（带 incumbent 序列 / ε-bound certificate）相关工具链在 2025 H2 - 2026 H1 的新进展，跟我们项目 P1 #7 ε-Certified 三阶段 168h split 直接相关。\n\n## 项目背景\n\n终末地工业规划器 70×70 exact LBBD 求解器。**P1 #7（ε-Certified 三阶段）刚完成 prep + 主体 4 hooks 集成**：\n- schema 加 bound_state（lb / ub / gap / epsilon_target / prover / model_hash）\n- BendersCut 加 epsilon_stage tag\n- master.fill_tightened_domains_in_response = True\n- master.set_hint_persistence_context (load + apply / extract + write)\n- LBBDController.set_epsilon_stage / extract_bound_state helper\n- bound regression guard + audit log\n\n剩下：outer_search 三阶段切分调度（25h / 50h / 85h budget）+ VeriPB exporter 适配（路线图 R11 #6 候选，未做）。\n\n## 上次调研\n\n- R3 `a6480e76a7177e6fd`（2026-05-08）：ε-Certified 1-5% gap is 1000× acceleration direction\n- R7 `a0ac44e2d03f4edb2`（2026-05-08）：5-day three-stage 5%→1%→0% with bound transfer\n- R11 `a823b529b0879c4bb`（2026-05-08）：8 patches ~5h schema_v4 / cut bucket / fill_tightened / hint persistence / VeriPB export — revealed P1 #7 missing engineering layer\n- R10 `acb9bd4fdd02868c2`（2026-05-08）：168h three-stage budget (25h/50h/85h) + 75h hard checkpoint + Stage-3 dual-growth diagnostic\n\n## 调研任务\n\n**用 WebSearch / WebFetch 查 学术 / 工具更新**：\n\n1. **VeriPB / cake_lpr 半年进展**:\n   - GitHub: gitlab.com/MIAOresearch/software/VeriPB\n   - 2025-2026 H1 release\n   - 是否新增 PB-OPT 优化证书格式（针对 ε-bound proof，不只是 UNSAT）\n   - cake_lpr 跟 PB Competition 2025 适配状态\n\n2. **新 anytime CP 工具**:\n   - Lecoutre / Boussemart 新论文（2025 H2）\n   - any2 / 之类 anytime SAT solver\n   - CP 2025 / SAT 2025 上有没有 \"anytime certificate\" / \"ε-optimal proof\" paper\n\n3. **PB Competition 2025 结果**:\n   - cril.univ-artois.fr/PB25\n   - 哪些 solver 上分\n   - PB-OPT vs PB-DEC track 的最新格式要求\n\n4. **ε-Certified 三阶段实施工程经验**:\n   - 工业 LBBD anytime 实施案例（2025 paper）\n   - 25h / 50h / 85h 时间分配是否被新研究质疑或验证\n   - dual-growth diagnostic 实践经验\n\n5. **Bound transfer 跨实例的 SOTA**:\n   - 跨 candidate 跨 wave 的 dual bound 传递\n   - 是否有新 PoC 直接可借鉴\n\n## 输出格式（不超过 600 字，中文）\n\n```\n## VeriPB / cake_lpr 半年进展\n- 版本变化\n- PB-OPT 证书格式\n- 跟项目 P1 #7 适配难度\n\n## 新 anytime CP / SAT 论文\n- [(Title, paper venue, 一句话 takeaway)]\n- 影响 P1 #7 实施的几篇\n\n## PB Comp 2025\n- 主要 solver / 格式\n\n## 工程实施案例\n- 25h/50h/85h 三阶段是否被新工作 corroborate / refute\n- 实战 dual growth diagnostic 报告\n\n## verdict\n- VeriPB exporter（R11 #6）现在估时: [仍 90 min / 缩到 X / 不变 / 升级到 P3]\n- 路线图新加: [项 / 无]\n- P1 #7 主流程要不要新增 paper 引用 / 算法\n```\n\n## 操作准则\n\n- 必须 WebSearch / WebFetch 实际 paper / repo\n- 不要凭训练数据\n- 简洁\n\n开始。"},"uuid":"920ba9fb-d9eb-4bb9-8fad-3f192ced920b","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:53.984Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"920ba9fb-d9eb-4bb9-8fad-3f192ced920b","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a3356c51d9d10daab","attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_delta","addedNames":["CronCreate","CronDelete","CronList","EnterWorktree","ExitWorktree","Monitor","NotebookEdit","PushNotification","RemoteTrigger","TaskCreate","TaskGet","TaskList","TaskStop","TaskUpdate","WebFetch","WebSearch"],"addedLines":["CronCreate","CronDelete","CronList","EnterWorktree","ExitWorktree","Monitor","NotebookEdit","PushNotification","RemoteTrigger","TaskCreate","TaskGet","TaskList","TaskStop","TaskUpdate","WebFetch","WebSearch"],"removedNames":[],"readdedNames":[]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"2a82baf7-3af4-4e16-bd03-dc8b0eea3cac","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:53.985Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"2a82baf7-3af4-4e16-bd03-dc8b0eea3cac","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a3356c51d9d10daab","attachment":{"type":"skill_listing","content":"- update-config: Use this skill to configure the Claude Code harness via settings.json. Automated behaviors (\"from now on when X\", \"each time X\", \"whenever X\", \"before/after X\") require hooks configured in settings.json - the harness executes these, not Claude, so memory/preferences cannot fulfill them. Also use for: permissions (\"allow X\", \"add permission\", \"move permission to\"), env vars (\"set X=Y\"), hook troubleshooting, or any changes to settings.json/settings.local.json files. Examples: \"allow npm commands\", \"add bq permission to global settings\", \"move permission to user settings\", \"set DEBUG=true\", \"when claude stops show X\". For simple settings like theme/model, suggest the /config command.\n- keybindings-help: Use when the user wants to customize keyboard shortcuts, rebind keys, add chord bindings, or modify ~/.claude/keybindings.json. Examples: \"rebind ctrl+s\", \"add a chord shortcut\", \"change the submit key\", \"customize keybindings\".\n- simplify: Review changed code for reuse, quality, and efficiency, then fix any issues found.\n- fewer-permission-prompts: Scan your transcripts for common read-only Bash and MCP tool calls, then add a prioritized allowlist to project .claude/settings.json to reduce permission prompts.\n- loop: Run a prompt or slash command on a recurring interval (e.g. /loop 5m /foo). Omit the interval to let the model self-pace. - When the user wants to set up a recurring task, poll for status, or run something repeatedly on an interval (e.g. \"check the deploy every 5 minutes\", \"keep running /babysit-prs\"). Do NOT invoke for one-off tasks.\n- schedule: Create, update, list, or run scheduled remote agents (routines) that execute on a cron schedule. - When the user wants to schedule a recurring remote agent, set up automated tasks, create a cron job for Claude Code, or manage their scheduled agents/routines. Also use when the user wants a one-time scheduled run (\"run this once at 3pm\", \"remind me to check X tomorrow\").\n- claude-api: Build, debug, and optimize Claude API / Anthropic SDK apps. Apps built with this skill should include prompt caching. Also handles migrating existing Claude API code between Claude model versions (4.5 → 4.6, 4.6 → 4.7, retired-model replacements).\nTRIGGER when: code imports `anthropic`/`@anthropic-ai/sdk`; user asks for the Claude API, Anthropic SDK, or Managed Agents; user adds/modifies/tunes a Claude feature (caching, thinking, compaction, tool use, batch, files, citations, memory) or model (Opus/Sonnet/Haiku) in a file; questions about prompt caching / cache hit rate in an Anthropic SDK project.\nSKIP: file imports `openai`/other-provider SDK, filename like `*-openai.py`/`*-generic.py`, provider-neutral code, general programming/ML.\n- init: Initialize a new CLAUDE.md file with codebase documentation\n- review: Review a pull request\n- security-review: Complete a security review of the pending changes on the current branch","skillCount":10,"isInitial":true},"type":"attachment","uuid":"62519cf7-b0b2-4aee-ac32-d4bd0b8c69db","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:37:53.985Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
