{"parentUuid":"7fa9dd09-3c87-4929-a0a2-7c4c9881ca72","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a3356c51d9d10daab","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01PqbHNfocywkB2YhKioUZA3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"证据足够，写最终调研报告。\n\n## VeriPB / cake_lpr 半年进展\n- **VeriPB 进了 CP'25**：Koops/Le Berre/Myreen/Nordström/Oertel/Tan/Vinyals 在 CP 2025 发了《Practically Feasible Proof Logging for Pseudo-Boolean Optimization》（LIPIcs vol.340 #21），第一次把 PB 优化的 proof logging 推到工业可用——给 RoundingSat / Sat4j 全套技术（core-guided + LP/Farkas + cut）做了 logging。这是\"PB-OPT 真正能用\"的转折点。\n- **PB Comp 2025**：4 条 unconditional track（PBS/PBO 各带证书 + 不带），新增 parametric scaling 实验 track。VeriPB 是默认 checker，认证条目不通过 checker 就降为非 certified。**没有独立的\"dual bound 证书 / ε-gap 证书\"track**——证书还是 OPT/UNSAT 二值，没有 anytime 中间 bound 的标准格式。\n- **cake_lpr** 2026-02 升级 +5–10% 性能、binary -20%；CakePB 走 cake_pb 分支，和 VeriPB 是配对的 verified checker。\n- **跟 P1 #7 适配难度**：核心结论——**PB-OPT 证书目前只能证\"最终 lb=ub\"，不天然支持中间 ε-gap 证书**。R11 #6 想做的\"导出 ε-bound certificate\"得自定义把 epsilon_stage 的 lb 写成 PB 约束 + 单独 cert，没有现成 schema。\n\n## 新 anytime CP / SAT 论文\n- **Lübke & Berg, CP'25** \"SLS-Enhanced Core-Boosted Linear Search for Anytime Maximum Satisfiability\"——核心 + SLS hybrid 改 anytime MaxSAT 收益曲线，思路可借鉴：早期 SLS 灌 incumbent / 后期 core-guided 收 lb，跟 P1 #7 三阶段（5%→1%→0%）阶段分工同构。\n- **Bessa et al., AAAI'25** \"Learning Valid Dual Bounds in CP: Boosted Lagrangian Decomposition with Self-Supervised Learning\"——learned dual bound for CP，跟 P1 #7 stage-3 dual-growth 慢的诊断方向相关；不是直接可用，但说明 ML-aided bound transfer 有 SOTA。\n- 没找到题为\"anytime ε-optimal certificate\"的 paper——这块仍是空白学术方向。\n- **CP'24** Boudreault & Quimper《Multi-Stage Proof Logging Framework for CP Solvers》是 P1 #7 多阶段 logging 的 prior art，CP'25 没续作。\n\n## PB Comp 2025\n- 主要 solver：Exact、PRINTEMPS、NaPS、SCIP；RoundingSat 唯一用 unchecked deletion 模式的。\n- 格式：跟 PB24 同（OPB + VeriPB pbp），无 ε-gap 扩展。\n\n## 工程实施案例\n- **25h/50h/85h 三阶段**：找不到任何 2025-2026 文献 corroborate 或 refute 这个具体切分；Lübke&Berg anytime MaxSAT 强调\"核心切换时机由 plateau detect\"而不是固定时间——跟我们硬切 25h/50h 不同，可能是个潜在改进点（动态切换 vs 固定 budget）。\n- **dual-growth diagnostic**：未见同名实战报告。Bessa et al. 提到 Lagrangian dual 在 CP 收敛慢的标准诊断是\"bound improvement per iter < ε for K iter\"——跟我们 75h hard checkpoint 同思路，validation 半侧。\n\n## verdict\n- **VeriPB exporter（R11 #6）原 90 min 估时升到 4-6h**：CP'25 paper 说明工具链已实用，但 ε-bound 中间证书**没有标准 schema**——要自己写 epsilon_stage→PB 约束 transcoder + 一次性 certify 每个 stage 的 lb。建议先做 Stage-3 的 final OPT cert，中间 ε-gap cert 暂缓。\n- **路线图新加 1 项**：参考 Lübke&Berg，把 P1 #7 的\"固定 25h/50h/85h\"加一个 plateau-based 动态切换 fallback（Stage-2 提前进 Stage-3 if dual_growth_rate < threshold for 4h）——估时 2h，纯调度逻辑。\n- **P1 #7 主流程引用**：可在 epsilon_stage tag 注释处引 CP'25 #21 (Koops et al.) 作 PB-OPT certified path 的 prior art；引 Lübke&Berg anytime MaxSAT 解释多阶段切换。算法本身不动。\n- **核心 takeaway**：PB-OPT 半年内变得\"工业可用\"但没扩展到 anytime ε-cert，我们的 schema 是\"对的方向但走在 standard 前面\"，自定义 transcoder 不可避免。\n\nSources:\n- [CP'25 Practically Feasible Proof Logging for PB Optimization](https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol340-cp2025/LIPIcs.CP.2025.21/LIPIcs.CP.2025.21.pdf)\n- [PB Competition 2025](http://www.cril.univ-artois.fr/PB25/)\n- [VeriPB+CakePB SAT'25 docs](https://jakobnordstrom.se/docs/publications/DocumentationVeriPBandCakePBforSATcompetition2025.pdf)\n- [cake_lpr SAT'25](https://satcompetition.github.io/2025/downloads/checkers/cakelpr.pdf)\n- [CP 2025 accepted papers](https://cp2025.a4cp.org/accepted_papers.html)\n- [Bessa et al. AAAI'25 Learning Valid Dual Bounds in CP](https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.12695)\n- [CP'24 Multi-Stage Proof Logging](https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol307-cp2024/LIPIcs.CP.2024.11/LIPIcs.CP.2024.11.pdf)"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3848,"cache_read_input_tokens":42016,"output_tokens":2256,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3848},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":2256,"cache_read_input_tokens":42016,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3848,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3848,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Cassntfp2hdCMXQub3Zjp","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"8dfa4b88-1d08-4ca6-88d6-8a5a6ae433d3","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:39:36.663Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
